ness Process\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"A business process, such as procurement, to which an invoice can be assigned.\\\" .\\n\\n:Standard a owl:Class ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"Standard\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"A standard (e.g., EN 16931-1) to which a document conforms.\\\" .\\n\\n:ValidationConstraint a owl:Class ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"Validation Constraint\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"A constraint, such as a SHACL shape, used for automated validation.\\\" .\\n\\n:KnowledgeGraph a owl:Class ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"Knowledge Graph\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"A knowledge graph representing the extracted and validated business information.\\\" .\\n\\n#################################################################\\n# Object Properties\\n#################################################################\\n\\n:containsMessage a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InterchangeEnvelope ;\\n    rdfs:range :Message ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"contains message\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Links an interchange envelope to its contained message(s).\\\" .\\n\\n:hasSection a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :Message ;\\n    rdfs:range :MessageSection ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has section\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Links a message to its logical sections (header, detail, summary).\\\" .\\n\\n:hasSegment a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :MessageSection ;\\n    rdfs:range :EDIFACTSegment ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has segment\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Links a message section to its EDIFACT segments.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasCompositeElement a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :EDIFACTSegment ;\\n    rdfs:range :CompositeDataElement ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has composite element\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Links a segment to its composite data elements.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasSimpleElement a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :CompositeDataElement ;\\n    rdfs:range :SimpleDataElement ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has simple element\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\